            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>There are a significant number of patients in society who have some form of psychiatric disorder. It is important that dental practitioners have an awareness of the more common psychiatric disorders and their potential implications as they are likely to encounter them in clinical practice.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
